WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
Xiaotie, please take a look quickly

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,640
What the hell is wrong with this?

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,360
I had a fever for three days and then it went away again.

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,800
The hospital can't find anything wrong

5
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,960
Gao Fuchun, you have this time

6
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,830
Wouldn't you like to fight off the fever?

7
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:13,610
What's the use of inviting a kid?

8
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:14,690
The child was frightened

9
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:16,530
There's a ghost that won't go away and keeps haunting her

10
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:18,650
If this woman doesn’t believe you, ask her

11
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:20,650
Is there a black handprint on the child's left foot?

12
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:22,770
Sister-in-law, let me just say one thing

13
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:24,490
She has a black handprint on her left foot

14
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:26,650
If you don't believe me, I'll leave right away

15
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:30,010
what are you looking for

16
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:31,770
I change my son’s clothes these days

17
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:38,420
I didn’t see any slap print liars at all.

18
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:43,730
Xiaotie, don’t be as knowledgeable as her.

19
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:44,770
What is this

20
00:00:44,770 --> 00:00:46,410
Sister-in-law, what are you doing?

21
00:00:46,410 --> 00:00:47,530
If you don’t believe me, let’s change it.

22
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:53,990
There are too many boys from the great god within a hundred miles radius.

23
00:00:53,990 --> 00:00:57,940
Okay, sister-in-law, let’s go back to the house

24
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:03,570
Wang Xian, please excuse me.

25
00:01:03,570 --> 00:01:04,890
Why do you keep pestering her?

26
00:01:04,890 --> 00:01:07,210
I want to go home and I'm not pestering her

27
00:01:07,210 --> 00:01:09,130
She was almost killed by a water turtle and into a water ladder.

28
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:10,690
I came back to life to save her

29
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:12,690
Once I'm in, I can't get out.

30
00:01:12,690 --> 00:01:15,370
Have you seen that water ghost before?

31
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:17,130
She was looking for a substitute by the river

32
00:01:17,130 --> 00:01:18,330
She pulled her ankles

33
00:01:18,330 --> 00:01:19,810
So the handprints slip on the ankles

34
00:01:19,810 --> 00:01:21,370
Don't let your children go to the river these days

35
00:01:21,370 --> 00:01:23,250
That old water ghost doesn't care about the size of his substitute.

36
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:24,820
she didn't lie

37
00:01:24,820 --> 00:01:26,420
Maybe the water ghost is still sneaking by the river

38
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:27,580
This matter is not over yet
